    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should call someone but i just feel so hollow. it's like everything is already gone and i'm just a shell waiting for the end. why is it so hard for people to understand that sometimes there just isn't anything left to save? it feels more like an mercy to just let the house be dark instead of forcing myself to pretend i'm still in here.",
